rces></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DAIKIN IND LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DOMYO NOBUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KITA KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DAIKIN INDUSTRIES, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOMYO, NOBUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITA, KOICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DOMYO NOBUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KITA KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOMYO, NOBUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITA, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A refrigerating device, wherein a compressor (11), a four-way switching valve (12), an outdoor heat exchanger (13), an expansion valve (14), and an indoor heat exchanger (15) are connected in order through gas side pipes (31) and liquid side pipes (32) so as to form a refrigerating circuit (10), a single R32 refrigerant or an R32/R125 mixed refrigerant containing at least 75 wt. % of R32 is filled into the refrigerant circuit (10), a synthetic oil is used as a refrigerating machine oil and, when a rated cooling capacity is 5 kW or below, the liquid side pipes (32) are formed of those pipes which are 4.75 mm or less in inside diameter.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif frigorifique. Un compresseur (11), une soupape de commutation à quatre voies (12), un échangeur thermique d'extérieur (13), un détendeur (14) et un échangeur thermique d'intérieur (15) sont connectés en ordre dans des tubes côté gaz (31) et des tubes côté liquide (32) de sorte qu'ils forment un circuit frigorifique (10). Un frigorigène unique R32 ou un frigorigène mélangé R32/R125 contenant au moins 75 % en poids de R32 est injecté dans le circuit frigorifique (10). Une huile synthétique est utilisée comme huile de machine frigorifique. Lorsqu'une capacité nominale de refroidissement est égale à 5 kW ou moins, les tubes côté liquide (32) sont constitués de tubes présentant un diamètre intérieur de 4,75 mm ou moins.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>